# Health Connectivity DApp - environment template
#
# Copy to `.env.local` (git-ignored) and adjust for local development.
#
# IMPORTANT: none of these are needed in production. Inside a real Signet
# container the DApp receives { apiBaseUrl, apiToken } at runtime via
# secureInterface.getParameters() - the wallet/identity come from Signet too.
# These variables only configure the LOCAL DEV mock host (src/app/page.tsx) and
# they are never read by the bundled DApp (init.tsx).

# ─── Local dev mock (src/app/page.tsx) ────────────────────────────────────────
# What the mock secureInterface.getParameters() returns to the DApp locally.

# TrustVault storage API base URL the DApp uploads encrypted archives to.
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8080

# Bearer token the mock hands the DApp for that storage API.
NEXT_PUBLIC_DEV_API_TOKEN=dev-mock-token
